    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Hey\u2014Hey! Is anyone here?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "It's gotten really dark... I just walked past the school, the cake shop, and the tailor shop that Rolena's mom used to run..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "If I keep going straight, I'll be in the next district."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Dammit... This road is barely walkable. Those nutjobs with the masks... Everything's changed all of a sudden, thanks to them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Yuri! Yuri, where are you?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "We were together just a moment ago... I was just trying to get us some water that we can drink!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Yuri's the youngest, and he's the most hurt. Where could he have gone by himself? Right, his wound was still bleeding... If I look out for the smell of blood... Uhh... It smells like blood everywhere."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Ugh, it stinks."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "No, I can't throw up. It took Oleg so long to find us dinner in the ruins."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
