    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "There it is again. It doesn't sound like the wind. Could it really be...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Yuri! Yuri, is that you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "It quieted down. Am I too far away? What was behind the wall again...? The department store's old storeroom?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "The storeroom's been empty the whole time, and the adults would never let us close to it. Oleg even said before that he'd help us sneak inside one day."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Did Yuri come in here by himself? It's so dark... I can't see through the gaps. Dammit, I guess I'm gonna have to climb inside."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "It's even darker in here. My face's all sticky... Is it the rain that dripped in from outside? Urgh, it smells..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Now I remember... The girls in school said there's something weird inside the storeroom."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "It's gotta be fake."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "But... I've already seen so many weird things going on these past few days..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "No, don't think about that right now, Anton. Don't be scared. You still need to find Yuri."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
