    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Someone's crying! Someone's crying over on that side! Now I heard it this time!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Yuri, is that you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "Anton...? Anton?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Yeah, it's me. I'm here. You don't need to be scared no more. I'll climb over there. Give me a second."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "Help... Help me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Hang in there. I'm almost there. What happened anyway? Why'd you run this far on your own all a sudden?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Isn't your leg hurt...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "Uhh... *Sobs*... T-There was a monster..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "A monster? What are you talking about, Yuri? Do you have a fever?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "A monster... brought me here..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "The monster you're talking about... What does it look like?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "I... I couldn't get a good look... I think it had black claws... And it had red eyes! It stared at me. I-I was so scared, I didn't know what was going on at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Black claws and red eyes? I think I heard of that before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Oh yeah, that's the ghost story that Lina from school talked about, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "Yeah... Lina said... She said any kids that don't go to bed at night will get a visit from the monster."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "It'll keep staring at you, and if your eyes are open and lock onto her red eyes, your soul will get sucked out right away."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "You'll turn into something like a marionette. You'll climb off your bed with the monster and follow it outside and onto the street. Then you'll keep following it... until you reach its nest."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "There, the monster will hang you up on the eaves... Just like how we hang sausages at home..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "And when it's hungry... It'll come suck your blood, one mouthful after another until your body's bone dry."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "*Sobs*... Anton, I can't possibly have..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Stop it. You're scaring yourself. This is just something the adults made up to get us to go to bed early, I'm sure of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "R-Really?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "Well, think about it. Did it hang you up?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "I... There's something holding my leg... Somewhere up high..."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "What?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "So... What Lina said's actually real, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "*sobs*... Anton... I don't wanna be eaten by the monster..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child",
        "text": "It's okay. I'll be there soon. We just gotta be fast. I'll carry you back before that mon... Before whatever it is comes back."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Scared Child",
        "text": "Yeah... N-No... Anton, stay away! Go back!"
